milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-13T15:20:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T12:43:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.stable\n(but I think this bug has been here for while)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Pop!_OS 22.04 LTS on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1260P (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen packing a node from code that has any child, I get this error unless I first remove the node I'm packing from the scene tree.\n```\nE 0:00:00:284   root.gd:6 @ _ready(): Condition \"!is_ancestor_of(p_node)\" is true. Returning: false\n  <C++ Source>  scene/main/node.cpp:2622 @ is_editable_instance()\n```\n\nSame as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/53292, perhaps the issue was only fixed in the case of no children\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a node structure like this:\n```\nroot\n- child\n    - subchild\n```\nPack the `child` node.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nrun the project to produce the error:\n\n[packscene_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19231462/packscene_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104074/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}